  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMERCIALIZING AGRICULTURE FOR INDUSTRIAL GROWTH PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support farmers and agri-SMEs to better access local, regional and global markets. The project will support the following key areas: market access; adoption of modern technologies, knowledge and skills development, enterprise development, access to finance, partnerships or joint ventures with experienced businesses from Ireland and Malawi for their productive capacitiesTo ensure gender equity in the economic sector, at least 60% of firms/farms will be women-led or owned, while 20% will be youth (aged between 18-35 years) with integration from both the rural and urban areas</narrative>
  </description>
